id: rice-cooker
name: Rice Cooker
kind: gear
tags: tech
craftDC: Apprentice
# Its Details.
details: technology
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Cooks rice: while Adventuring, 1 Hour and 1 Ingredient make a Snack, once a Session. It can
  also hold what the Sealing Unique Ability seals.
text: >
  Rice Cooker [Tech]: An electric pot designed to cook rice to delicious perfection.
  –Craft DC: Apprentice
  –Details: Technology
  –Effects: This item can cook rice. While Adventuring, you can spend 1 Hour and 1 Ingredient to
  produce a Snack Basic Item (this is considered an Adventuring Maneuver with a Session Limit of
  1). Additionally, it can be used as a container for the Sealing Unique Ability. While acting as
  a container, it cannot produce the Snack Basic Item through its effects.

---

# --- What is not built -------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Everything it does, each waiting on a system that is not here yet: the Adventuring Maneuver that
# makes the Snack (Adventuring, its Hours and its Session Limit), the Ingredient it uses, and the
# Sealing Unique Ability it can hold. Until then it is an entry the table reads, and a Snack it makes
# is given from the Gear tab.
